  "details": "Please add a toggle to enable radius grabbing of PhysBones on the same chain. Think proportional editing in Blender, but for PhysBones. \nThis setting would allow for grabbing multiple points on a PhysBone chain based on a falloff curve set by the avatar creator.\nThis would be desired on skirts, whiskers, hair, capes, flags, and other types of setups where there are multiple branches of bones that should act if they are connected. Currently, having to grab and pose each bone chain, despite being the same PhysBone component, can look a little awkward.\n\nnakos",
